        <body>
            <div xml:id="d813">

                <pb facs="0884" n="798" xml:id="pg798"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-15"><hi rendition="#italic">December 15,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen states that it is very important for him to know without delay whether
                    Great Britain and Germany will answer his proposal, on the part of Venezuela, of
                    arbitration.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
